    "faq_Fqyj6": {
      "type": "faq",
      "disabled": false,
      "settings": {
        "show_navigation": false,
        "title": "FULL RETURNS POLICY",
        "content": "",
        "header-38922d351a113c9cdf0a6aed858190ef": null,
        "background": "rgba(0,0,0,0)",
        "text_color": "rgba(0,0,0,0)"
      },
      "blocks": {
        "question_eawaT": {
          "type": "question",
          "disabled": false,
          "settings": {
            "title": "Tap to view our full returns policy",
            "answer": "<p><strong>60-Day Return Policy in short</strong></p><p>You have 60 days from receipt of delivery to confirm the suitability of your item(s). Should any of your order not be suitable,<br/>please contact our Customer Support Team via hello@williamwoodmirrors.co.uk. <br/><br/>Should you wish to return your order, or part of your order, this service is free up to 30 days of your order being received. Should you wish to return your order between 31-60 days after receipt of your order, the carriage fee below will apply:<br/><br/>£20 carriage fee for return of item(s) up to the value of £499 RRP<br/><br/>£40 carriage fee for return of item(s) over the value of £500 RRP<br/><br/>Please note this charge is applied per visit.</p><p><strong>Return of item(s) with damage/fault</strong></p><p>You have 7 days from receipt of your delivery to open and assess the condition of your item(s). Given the size and fragile nature of the products we supply, damages can occur in transit. If you do not intend to use the item for a longer period of time, please inspect to confirm the physical condition of the item(s). Please contact Customer Support Team via <a href=\"mailto:hello@williamwoodmirrors.co.uk\">hello@williamwoodmirrors.co.uk</a> and advise any damage that you have found on your item(s). </p><p>Should you find any damage or fault over a longer period of time, please contact warranty@williamwoodmirrors.co.uk</p><p><strong>Return Policy Exclusions</strong></p><p>All products are delivered in packaging that can be carefully opened and reused. We accept returns under the following packaging conditions, however a repackaging fee will apply when returning:</p><p>• Unboxed products</p><p>• Products returned in non-original packaging</p><p>• Original packaging returned in a condition unsuitable for reuse</p><p><strong>Repackaging Fees:<br/></strong><br/>· Products under £99 RRP: £15 (per unboxed item) fee applies<br/><br/>· Products £100 - £499 RRP: £30 (per unboxed item) fee applies<br/><br/>· Products £500 RRP and over: £45 (per unboxed item) fee applies<br/><br/><strong>Are there any circumstances where I may not return an item?</strong><br/><br/>Yes, a return may not be accepted if your product is being returned to us in a no longer ‘as new’ or is in a ‘used’ condition.<br/><br/>Signs of use and wear which may remove your ability to return a product:<br/><br/>• You have wall mounted your mirror<br/>• Your table displays signs of use and wear and tear<br/>• Your chair displays signs of use and wear and tear<br/>• Your product displays scuffs/marks obtained through use within your home environment<br/>• Your product displays scuffs/marks obtained through fair use within your home environment</p><p><strong>Exchanges</strong></p><p>We offer <strong>one free exchange per order</strong>, including free collection and delivery of your new item (completed on a single visit to your property).</p><p>Should you wish to make additional<br/><br/>exchange beyond this, a delivery fee of £15 will apply for each subsequent exchange.</p><p><strong>Exchange to Pre Order item(s)</strong></p><p>Should you wish to exchange to a pre-order product, this shall take place throughout the advised pre-order week. If you did wish for the original item to be collected prior to the date advised, a £15.00 carriage fee will apply.</p><p><strong>Exchange of Free Gifts</strong></p><p>For exchanges of free gift items, a £15 carriage fee will apply.</p><p><strong>Returning Orders Containing a Free Gift</strong></p><p>If your order included a free gift<br/><br/>item, you may retain the free gift when partially returning your order, provided the<br/><br/>remaining order value still meets the minimum threshold required to qualify for<br/><br/>the free gift.</p><p>If after a return, your order value falls<br/><br/>below this threshold, the free gift must either:</p><p>1. Be returned with your returning items</p><p><strong>or</strong></p><p>2. Payment made equivalent to item price as stated at the time of your original order<br/><br/>(this amount may be deducted from your refund).</p><p><strong>Returns on Discounted Bundle Orders</strong></p><p>If you return part of an order that was<br/><br/>placed using a multi-item bundle discount, the remaining items in your order will be re-evaluated under the relevant offer tier. For example:</p><p>• If a “30% off three or more full priced items” promotion was used, and one item is returned, the remaining two items will be adjusted to the “25% off two full priced items” pricing.</p><p>• The price difference will be deducted from your refund</p><p> <strong>Promotional Code Misuse or Reuse</strong></p><p>Our promotional codes are updated<br/><br/>frequently to give customers the best possible value. If you have already<br/><br/>received your order and wish to return your item(s) solely to repurchase them<br/><br/>using a different promotional code, a £15 return carriage fee will apply.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "question_eawaT"
      ],
      "name": "FAQ"
    },
